@startuml Payment_Customer
!theme plain

actor Customer
participant "Frontend\n/app/rooms/[id]/page.tsx\n/app/stripe/success/page.tsx\n/app/my-bookings/page.tsx" as Frontend
participant "Stripe Checkout\n/api/stripe/checkout" as Stripe
participant "Backend API\n/src/controllers/bookings.controller.ts\n/src/controllers/payments.controller.ts\n/src/controllers/invoices.controller.ts" as API
database "MongoDB\n(Collection: bookings, payments, invoices)" as DB

Customer -> Frontend: Chọn thanh toán qua Stripe
Frontend -> Stripe: Tạo Stripe checkout session

Stripe --> Frontend: Checkout URL
Frontend --> Customer: Redirect đến Stripe

Customer -> Stripe: Thanh toán trên Stripe
Stripe --> Customer: Thanh toán thành công

Customer -> Frontend: Quay về success page
Frontend -> API: Tạo booking từ dữ liệu đã lưu

API -> DB: Tạo booking
DB --> API: Booking created

API -> DB: Tạo invoice
DB --> API: Invoice created

API -> DB: Tạo payment record
DB --> API: Payment created

API --> Frontend: Success + booking + invoice
Frontend --> Customer: Hiển thị thành công

Customer -> Frontend: Xem lịch sử thanh toán
Frontend -> API: (customerId)

API -> DB: Query payments theo customerId
DB --> API: Danh sách payments

API --> Frontend: Danh sách payments
Frontend --> Customer: Hiển thị lịch sử

Customer -> Frontend: Xem hóa đơn/Xuất PDF
Frontend -> API: (invoiceId)

API -> DB: Query invoice
DB --> API: Invoice data

API --> Frontend: Invoice data hoặc PDF
Frontend --> Customer: Hiển thị hóa đơn hoặc tải PDF
@enduml

